            "review_title": "Review at Quan 5 Ngon",
            "review_text": "Rod T\nSunshine Coast, Australia49 contributions\n0\nDinner at the Ngon\nSep 2017 • Couples\n2 locals recommended this restaurant within 24 hours of arriving. Fantastic selection of all Asian foods, but we wanted the Vietnamese selection and this was superb. Very busy but still got allocated a seat without booking quite quickly, then once we decided what we wanted - meals were presented in about 5-7 mins. NB: Every meal on menu comes with picture - don't be put off by small picture sizes, meal sizes are very generous and excellent prices (very cheap compared to Australia anyway!). Loved it - 10 out of 10!\nRead more\nWritten October 14, 2017",
